{"id":"4a74b59e369ba8a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Semi Ring Of Sets","display":"df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Semi Ring Of Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Semi Ring Of Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Semi Ring Of Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" href=\"?note=17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md\">../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal S\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal S\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S\\)</span> is pairwise disjointness of two sets (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" href=\"?note=17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md\">../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}semi\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal S=X\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\exists F\\in[\\mathcal S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(A\\setminus B=\\bigcup F\\land\\forall C,D\\in F\\;(C\\neq D\\to\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S(C,D))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}semi\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal S=X\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\exists F\\in[\\mathcal S]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(A\\setminus B=\\bigcup F\\land\\forall C,D\\in F\\;(C\\neq D\\to\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S(C,D))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md","status":"resolved","id":"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md","status":"resolved","id":"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S$ is pairwise disjointness of two sets (see [[../batch01/58-df-disjoint.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}semi\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal S=X\\land\\emptyset\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal S\\land\\exists F\\in[\\mathcal S]^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl(A\\setminus B=\\bigcup F\\land\\forall C,D\\in F\\;(C\\neq D\\to\\mathrm{Disjoint}_S(C,D))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"d805ec13e8dbede3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal A)$ is the semiring predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2602","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","17c8f9ebc93d5a7a","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}